OL,3,GNEWSASEND mothers continue to battle
OL,4,Afines over school attendance
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor over four years a group of mothers
OL,7,Fhave been fighting for parents with
OL,8,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,9,Fand disabilities (SEND) to be exempt
OL,10,Ffrom school absence fines.
OL,12,FOn Tuesday the group, called No School
OL,13,FFines, handed a petition with 290,000
OL,14,Fsignatures to 10 Downing Street with
OL,15,Fthe support of Motherland actor Anna
OL,16,FMaxwell Martin.
OL,18,FIt called for families with children
OL,19,Fwho have, or were suspected to have,
OL,20,FSEND not to be fined and prosecuted
OL,21,Fwhen they do not attend school.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
